WEBVTT

NOTE Machine translated from English captions; target=yo.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Fidio yii ṣe afihan bi o ṣe le ṣe iṣiro neurovision ati fifun awọn gilaasi.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Fọ ọwọ rẹ ki o ma ṣe pee.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Iwọ yoo nilo apẹrẹ neurovision, pen ati awọn akọsilẹ ile-iwosan, ibiti

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
ti awọn gilaasi kika ati okun 40cm gigun kan.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Ṣe alaye ohun ti iwọ yoo ṣe ni gbigba igbanilaaye.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Joko alaisan ni itunu ni aaye ti o tan daradara.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
Lo okun kan lati rii daju pe chart wa ni idaduro ni ijinna 40cm to pe.

8
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.740
Beere wọn lati ka isalẹ chart pẹlu awọn oju mejeeji papọ.

9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Ṣe igbasilẹ laini ti o kere julọ ti wọn le ka ni itunu.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
Ti wọn ko ba le ka laini N8, lẹhinna gbiyanju pẹlu awọn gilaasi sphere 1,5 diopter.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
Ti wọn ba tun le ka N8, lẹhinna lo agbara giga ti o tẹle, ati bẹbẹ lọ

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
lori, titi ti won le ni itunu

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
ka N8 ọrọ.

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.660
Rii daju pe gilasi jẹ fiddle-k ati pe alaisan naa ni idunnu pẹlu irisi wọn.
